<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30885" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴδωλον</span></b> , τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>phantom</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.451
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.796
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.92
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				959b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βροτῶν εἴδωλα καμόντων</span>,
			of ghosts, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.476
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>Inst.</u>
					64
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>any unsubstantial form</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴδωλον σκιᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					839
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				659.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Chaerem.
				14.15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν ἄλλο πλὴν εἴδωλα . . ἢ
					κούφην σκιάν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					126
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ. ἄλλως</span> a mere
				<i>form</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				947
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰῶνος εἴ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				131.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>image reflected</i> in a mirror or in water, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				266b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Div.Somn.</u>
				464b9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> in the system
			of Epicurus, <i>film</i> given off by any object and conveying an
			impression to the eye, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1p.10U.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Nat.</u>
				2.1
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Fam.</u>
				15.16.1
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>image in the mind, idea</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				4.21
			</span></i>; <i>phantom of the mind, fancy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				66c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ. καὶ ψεῦδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					150c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>image, likeness</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναικὸς εἴ. χρύσεον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.51
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				6.58
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος εἴ. ψυχῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					3.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> later,
				<i>image of a god, idol</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>4 Ki.</u>
				17.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				12.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				201.8
			</span></i> (Silco, <span class="entity">vi A.D.</span>), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ. οὐράνια</span>
			<i>constellations</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.1004
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Max.
				56
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
